config PVM_SOCKET
	bool "PVM PF_INET provider with native loopback and host-backed egress"
	depends on PVM_GUEST && MINISANDBOX_GUEST && NET && INET && X86_64
	default y
	help
	  Own the public PF_INET family. IPv4 loopback TCP uses a hidden native
	  Linux INET socket and never leaves the guest. Other SOCK_STREAM traffic
	  maps to host-backed TCP; SOCK_DGRAM remains restricted to allowlisted
	  UDP DNS on port 53. External traffic crosses a fixed shared mailbox, and
	  only the separately audited host broker owns host network descriptors.
